+    objects or clean. Nothing an untracked object reaches changes, so it
+    cannot become part of a reference cycle; its reference count frees it as
+    before. A variant's IR, tuples and records are most of a trace's objects
+    and outlive it; the containers folds, redispatches and relowers extend
+    stay tracked. A walk stops at an untracked object, so a variant extended
+    again costs its tracked state, not its whole tape."""
